  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 10.0.0.8-Beta-01 - 2026-10-23\n\n- Write 401, 403, 404, and 500 bodies as the nested error envelope.\n- Reference APF.Core.Clean.Common 10.0.0.6-Beta-02 so validation failures use the same envelope.\n\n## 10.0.0.7-Beta-01 - 2026-10-19\n- update Core.Clean.Common version \n\n## 10.0.0.6-Beta-02 - 2026-10-12\n\n- Add standardized error messages to avoid technical messages in response during request deserialization.\n\n## 10.0.0.7 - 2026-10-12\n\n- Add standardized error messages to avoid technical messages in response during request deserialization.\n\n## 10.0.0.6 - 2026-09-10\n\n- Added .AddApiExplorer() with GroupNameFormat = \"'v'VVV\" and SubstituteApiVersionInUrl = false.\n- Added services.AddEndpointsApiExplorer().\n\n## 10.0.0.5 - 2026-09-11\n\n- handled x-version response structure error in ApiVersioningProblemDetailsWriter (included missing details obj)\n\n## 10.0.0.4 - 2026-09-09\n\n- Ip address fix testing for EKS(Release)\n\n## 10.0.0.3 - 2026-09-04\n\n- Added support for configurable success status codes in Result responses.\n\n## 10.0.0.2 - 2026-08-30\n\n- Log validation and internal server exceptions with stack traces\n\n## 10.0.0.1 - 2026-08-14\n\n- release package of version 10.0.0.01-Beta-08",
